GET choroid/rarf/count
Returns the total count of RARF records.

GET choroid/rarf
Returns all RARF data.

GET choroid/rarf/session/{sessionId}/registeredCount
Returns the count of RARF records registered for a specific session identified by its session ID.

GET choroid/rarf/session/{sessionId}/attendedCount
Returns the count of RARF records marked as attended for a specific session (i.e. feedback_filled is true) identified by its session ID.

GET choroid/rarf/user/{userId}/registeredCount
Returns the count of RARF records registered by a specific user identified by their user ID.

GET choroid/rarf/user/{userId}/attendedCount
Returns the count of RARF records marked as attended (i.e. feedback_filled is true) by a specific user identified by their user ID.

GET choroid/rarf/session/{sessionId}/all
Returns all RARF records for a specific session identified by its session ID.

GET choroid/rarf/user/{userId}/all
Returns all RARF records for a specific user identified by their user ID.

GET choroid/rarf/session/{sessionId}/stats
Returns statistical data (like average ratings and other scores) for a specific session identified by its session ID.

GET choroid/rarf/session/stats
Returns statistical data (like average ratings and other scores) for all sessions.

GET choroid/rarf/session/{sessionId}
Returns the RARF data for a session identified by its session ID (paginated).

GET choroid/rarf/user/{userId}
Returns all RARF sessions associated with a specific user identified by their user ID (paginated).

GET choroid/rarf/session/{sessionId}/user{userId}
Returns the RARF data for a specific user within a specific session.

POST choroid/rarf/register
Registers a user for a session where the user ID and session ID are specified in the request body.

PATCH choroid/rarf/session/{sessionId}/user/{userId}
Updates the RARF data for a specific user within a specific session with the details provided in the request body.

DELETE choroid/rarf/session/{sessionId}/user/{userId}
Deletes the RARF data for a specific user within a specific session.